@startuml mg400_state_diagram

title MG400 Robot State Transition Diagram

state "ID 1: ROBOT_MODE_INIT" as Init
state "ID 4: ROBOT_MODE_DISABLED" as Disabled
state "ID 5: ROBOT_MODE_ENABLE" as Enable
state "ID 6: ROBOT_MODE_BACKDRIVE" as Backdrive
state "ID 7: ROBOT_MODE_RUNNING" as Running
state "ID 9: ROBOT_MODE_ERROR" as Error

[*] --> Init : Power On

Init --> Disabled : Initialization Complete

Disabled --> Enable : EnableRobot()

Enable --> Running : Start Motion
Enable --> Disabled : DisableRobot()
Enable --> Backdrive : Push unlock button
Enable --> Error : Occur errors

Running --> Enable : Motion Complete
Running --> Error : Motion Error

Backdrive --> Enable : Exit Drag Mode
Backdrive --> Error : Drag Error

Error --> Enable : Error Cleared

' state "MG400のTCP/IP では通常使用しない状態" as UnusedStates #lightgray {
'   state "ID 2: ROBOT_MODE_BRAKE_OPEN" as BrakeOpen
'   state "ID 8: ROBOT_MODE_RECORDING" as Recording
