'   state "ID 11: ROBOT_MODE_JOG" as Jog

'   BrakeOpen -[hidden]down-> Recording
'   Recording -[hidden]down-> Pause
'   Pause -[hidden]down-> Jog
' }

note as N1
  MG400のTCP/IP操作では基本的に不使用な状態:
  - ID 2: ROBOT_MODE_BRAKE_OPEN
  - ID 8: ROBOT_MODE_RECORDING
  - ID 10: ROBOT_MODE_PAUSE
  - ID 11: ROBOT_MODE_JOG
end note

@enduml